dsh-browser-vision README · Structured output：```bash
dsbrowser "Open https://example.com/pricing and list every plan" --json --schema '{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "plans": {"type": "array", "items": {

`--schema` also takes a path to a `.json` file. Objects, arrays, primitives, enums, unions and local
`$ref`s are supported; the top level must be an object, so wrap a bare list in a property. Optional
properties come back as `null` rather than forcing the agent to invent a value it could not find.

dsh-browser-vision README · 结构化输出：用 `--schema` 读一张扫描件发票，这一个调用就是整个工具的缩影：看见页面、抽取字段、返回校验过的 JSON。

```json
{
  "invoiceNumber": "5512-B",
  "totalDue": "$128.40",
  "lineItems": [

上面这些内容 DOM 里一个字都没有，发票就是一张 PNG。一次模型调用，10.9 秒，$0.0013（¥0.0089）。

传入一个 JSON Schema，答案就会以校验过的对象返回，而不是一段散文，调用方也就不需要再花一次模型调用去解析：

```bash
dsbrowser "打开 https://example.com/pricing 并列出所有套餐" --json --schema '{
  "type": "object",
